Befriend the natural elements that constitute nature. Each time you are hit by one of the elements, you gain a special effect for 5 turns. This can only happen every 5 turns.

Fire: [+10%, +16%, +21%, +26%, +29% (TL1-5)] global speed

Cold: [+8, +12, +17, +21, +25 (TL1-5)] Armour

Lightning: [+5, +9, +13, +16, +20 (TL1-5)] to all stats

Acid: [+10, +19, +26, +33, +40 (TL1-5)] life regen

Nature: [+4%, +7%, +10%, +12%, +15% (TL1-5)] to all resists
